ChemmineOB links to the Open Babel C++ library. Open Babel is not a system
requirement: it is provided, as a static library together with its headers and
data files, by the Bioconductor package Ropenbabel. Installing ChemmineOB from
source only needs Ropenbabel, Rcpp, RcppEigen and BH to be installed, plus a
C++17 compiler and GNU make:

  BiocManager::install("ChemmineOB")

or, from a source tarball:

  R CMD INSTALL ChemmineOB_x.y.z.tar.gz

Compiler and linker flags come from Ropenbabel::pkgconfig() (see
src/Makevars). At load time ChemmineOB sets BABEL_DATADIR to
Ropenbabel::dataDir() unless BABEL_DATADIR is already set.
